<title>USA: PRI Automation says CFO Schickling resigns.</title>
<headline>PRI Automation says CFO Schickling resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PRI Automation Inc said on Wednesday that Chief Financial Officer John Schickling resigned.</p>
<p>Schickling has agreed to continue on a part-time basis until a replacement is found. He plans to explore opportunities in organizations that are in need of the financial, equity and business structure development.</p>
<p>PRI Automation, based in Billerica, Mass., supplies factory automation systems.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
